{
  "profile": "zatsugaku",
  "generated_at": "2026-08-26T10:01:16+09:00",
  "title": "電車を曲げているのは車輪のツバではない 〜円錐が勝手に舵を切る〜",
  "audio_path": "zatsugaku_latest.wav",
  "duration_sec": 390.03,
  "script_hash": "sha256:8ae4675e482032fe73c847aafb1bed19a7e8f0da81d300eb6fcf0d305df6cd53",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": -1,
      "type": "intro",
      "text": "🎵 ジングル + 旅の道ラジオ！",
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 4.64
    },
    {
      "index": 0,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "mic",
      "text": "旅の道ラジオ、雑学チャンネル。解説担当の、あんこもんだもん。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 4.64,
      "end_sec": 9.32
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "mic",
      "text": "聞き役のずんだもんなのだ！今日は何の話なのだ？",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 9.47,
      "end_sec": 12.88
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "niyari",
      "text": "今日は電車の車輪の話だもん。電車って、どうやってカーブを曲がってると思う？",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 13.03,
      "end_sec": 18.07
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "え、そんなの簡単なのだ。レールが曲がってるから、それに沿って曲がるのだ。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 18.22,
      "end_sec": 23.15
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "じゃあ、なんでレールから落ちないんだもん？",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 23.3,
      "end_sec": 25.85
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "amaama",
      "text": "それも知ってるのだ！車輪の内側にツバがついてるのだ。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 26.0,
      "end_sec": 30.1
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "あれがレールに引っかかって、外に飛び出さないようになってるのだ。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 30.18,
      "end_sec": 34.13
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "shirake",
      "text": "……出たもん。みんなそう答えるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 34.28,
      "end_sec": 37.36
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "えっ、違うのだ！？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 37.51,
      "end_sec": 39.09
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "ツバがあるのは本当だもん。フランジっていって、脱線を防ぐ大事な部品だもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 39.24,
      "end_sec": 44.37
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "じゃあ合ってるじゃないのだ。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 44.52,
      "end_sec": 46.09
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "でも、普通に走ってるときカーブを曲がらせてるのは、フランジじゃないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 46.24,
      "end_sec": 50.96
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "は！？じゃあ何が曲げてるのだ！？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 51.11,
      "end_sec": 53.93
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "niyari",
      "text": "車輪の形だもん。電車の車輪って、実はまっすぐな円筒じゃないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 54.08,
      "end_sec": 58.91
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "まっすぐじゃない……？どういうことなのだ？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 59.06,
      "end_sec": 61.74
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "レールに乗ってる面が、ほんの少し斜めに削ってあるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 61.89,
      "end_sec": 65.56
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "外側にいくほど細くなってる。円錐を薄く切ったような形だもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 65.64,
      "end_sec": 69.88
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "miage",
      "text": "うーん、ボクの中の車輪はドーナツみたいな形なのだ。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 70.03,
      "end_sec": 74.06
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "kamera",
      "text": "近くで見ると違うんだもん。日本の在来線だと、10分の1から20分の1くらいの傾きだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 74.21,
      "end_sec": 80.57
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "ほとんど平らじゃないのだ。そんなちょっとの傾きで何が変わるのだ？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 80.72,
      "end_sec": 84.95
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "それが、カーブを曲がるかどうかを決めてるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 85.1,
      "end_sec": 88.04
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "そんなに効くのだ！？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 88.19,
      "end_sec": 89.56
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "kamera",
      "text": "順番に見ていくもん。まず、電車の車輪には決定的な弱点があるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 89.71,
      "end_sec": 94.72
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "弱点……？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 94.87,
      "end_sec": 95.8
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "左右の車輪が、1本の車軸にがっちり固定されてるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 95.95,
      "end_sec": 99.86
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "うん。だから一緒に回るのだ。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 100.01,
      "end_sec": 102.19
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "そう。左だけ速く回す、みたいなことができないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 102.34,
      "end_sec": 106.34
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "amaama",
      "text": "別にいいんじゃないのだ？一緒に回れば進むのだ。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 106.49,
      "end_sec": 110.26
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "tsuntsun",
      "text": "よくないもん。カーブだと、外側と内側で進む距離が違うんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 110.41,
      "end_sec": 115.01
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "あっ……。運動会のトラックみたいなことなのだ？",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 115.16,
      "end_sec": 118.54
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "nagomi",
      "text": "そうだもん。外側のレーンの方が長いから、同じだけ走ったら曲がりきれないもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 118.69,
      "end_sec": 123.97
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "同じ回転数しか出せないのに、距離が違うのだ！？矛盾してるのだ！",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 124.12,
      "end_sec": 129.82
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "sasayaki",
      "text": "そこを、あの少しの傾きが解決してるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 1,
      "start_sec": 129.97,
      "end_sec": 134.37
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kamera",
      "text": "え、あの斜めがそんな仕事をしてるのだ？",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 134.52,
      "end_sec": 137.56
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "電車がカーブに入ると、車輪はレールの外側寄りを走ることになるもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 137.71,
      "end_sec": 142.24
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "外側に寄るってことなのだ？",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 142.39,
      "end_sec": 144.46
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "車輪と車軸がまとめて、ほんの少し外側にずれるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 144.61,
      "end_sec": 148.4
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "ずれる……。それで何が起きるのだ？",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 148.55,
      "end_sec": 151.0
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "外側の車輪は、太いところでレールに乗るんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 151.15,
      "end_sec": 154.36
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "内側の車輪は、逆に細いところで乗るもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 154.44,
      "end_sec": 157.53
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "あっ！同じ回転でも、進む距離が変わるのだ！",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 157.68,
      "end_sec": 161.06
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "amaama",
      "text": "気づいたもんね。太い方がたくさん進んで、細い方はあまり進まないもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 161.21,
      "end_sec": 165.99
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "それって、外側が長い距離を走るってことなのだ！まさにカーブなのだ！",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 166.14,
      "end_sec": 172.05
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "nagomi",
      "text": "そういうことだもん。誰も操作してないのに、勝手に曲がるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 172.2,
      "end_sec": 176.55
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "heart",
      "text": "車輪が自分で舵を切ってるのだ……。かっこいいのだ。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 176.7,
      "end_sec": 180.45
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "自己操舵って呼ばれてるもん。ハンドルもモーターも要らないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 180.6,
      "end_sec": 184.53
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "待つのだ。じゃあ直線ではどうなってるのだ？",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 184.68,
      "end_sec": 187.75
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "niyari",
      "text": "いい質問だもん。直線でも同じ仕組みが働いてるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 187.9,
      "end_sec": 191.71
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "直線は曲がらなくていいのだ。仕事がないのだ。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 191.86,
      "end_sec": 195.05
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "shirake",
      "text": "あるもん。線路のど真ん中を走り続けるのって、実はすごく難しいんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 195.2,
      "end_sec": 201.84
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "miage",
      "text": "……言われてみれば、少しくらいズレそうなのだ。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 201.99,
      "end_sec": 204.93
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "ズレるもん。でも右にズレると、右の車輪が太いところで乗るもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 205.08,
      "end_sec": 209.38
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "右がたくさん進む……。ってことは、左に戻るのだ？",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 209.53,
      "end_sec": 213.32
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "戻るんだもん。放っておいても真ん中に帰ってくるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 213.47,
      "end_sec": 216.92
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "勝手に直るのだ！？車輪、有能すぎるのだ！",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 217.07,
      "end_sec": 220.41
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "ただ、これには困った副作用があるもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 220.56,
      "end_sec": 223.25
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "namidame",
      "text": "急に不安になってきたのだ。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 223.4,
      "end_sec": 225.8
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "戻りすぎるんだもん。真ん中を通り越して、今度は反対にズレるもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 225.95,
      "end_sec": 230.52
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "で、また戻る……。行ったり来たりなのだ？",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 230.67,
      "end_sec": 233.57
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "そうだもん。ダコウドウっていって、左右にゆらゆら揺れ続けるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 233.72,
      "end_sec": 238.28
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "せっかくの自動操縦が、酔いそうな乗り物になったのだ！",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 238.43,
      "end_sec": 243.03
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "sasayaki",
      "text": "速度が上がるほどひどくなるもん。乗り心地が悪くなるだけじゃないもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 243.18,
      "end_sec": 248.85
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "まさか……。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 249.0,
      "end_sec": 249.73
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "揺れが大きくなると、フランジがレールを叩くもん。ひどいと脱線するんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 249.88,
      "end_sec": 254.52
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "namidame",
      "text": "さっきの有能な車輪はどこに行ったのだ……。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 254.67,
      "end_sec": 258.12
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "だから鉄道の技術って、この揺れをどう抑えるかとずっと戦ってるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 258.27,
      "end_sec": 263.07
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "傾きを無くせばいいんじゃないのだ？揺れないのだ。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 263.22,
      "end_sec": 266.52
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "shirake",
      "text": "そうしたら自分で曲がる力が無くなるもん。フランジ頼みで、きしみながら通ることになるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 266.67,
      "end_sec": 274.52
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "herohero",
      "text": "あっちを立てればこっちが立たずなのだ……。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 274.67,
      "end_sec": 278.21
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "台車のバネやダンパーで、揺れだけを食い止める方向に進んだんだもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 278.36,
      "end_sec": 282.62
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "じゃあ新幹線があんなに速く走れるのも……。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 282.77,
      "end_sec": 285.74
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "nagomi",
      "text": "その積み重ねだもん。速度と揺れの綱引きに勝ってきた結果だもん。",
      "news_index": 2,
      "start_sec": 285.89,
      "end_sec": 290.06
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kamera",
      "text": "ところでボク、ずっと気になってることがあるのだ。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 290.21,
      "end_sec": 293.33
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "フランジのことだもん？",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 293.48,
      "end_sec": 294.9
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "amaama",
      "text": "そうなのだ！結局あのツバは何をしてるのだ？",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 295.05,
      "end_sec": 298.58
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "最後の保険だもん。普段は仕事してないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 298.73,
      "end_sec": 301.94
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "働いてないのだ！？",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 302.09,
      "end_sec": 303.55
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "普通に走ってるとき、フランジはレールに触ってすらいないもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 303.7,
      "end_sec": 307.56
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "ずっと浮いてたのだ！？",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 307.71,
      "end_sec": 309.49
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "レールに乗る面の傾きが真ん中に戻してくれるから、出番が無いんだもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 309.64,
      "end_sec": 314.09
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "じゃあ、いつ働くのだ？",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 314.24,
      "end_sec": 316.35
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "急なカーブとか、揺れが大きくなった時だもん。触れて、それ以上、外へ行かせないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 316.5,
      "end_sec": 322.44
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "nagomi",
      "text": "普段は黙ってて、いざという時だけ出てくるのだ。かっこいいのだ。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 322.59,
      "end_sec": 326.9
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "hazukashi",
      "text": "……そういう言い方をされると、なんか照れるもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 327.05,
      "end_sec": 330.15
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "niyari",
      "text": "あんこもんが照れてるのだ。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 330.3,
      "end_sec": 332.21
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "tsuntsun",
      "text": "照れてないもん。次の話に行くもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 332.36,
      "end_sec": 334.78
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "この仕組み、車ではやってないんだもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 334.86,
      "end_sec": 337.41
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kangae",
      "text": "なんでなのだ？車もカーブを曲がるのだ。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 337.56,
      "end_sec": 340.51
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "車のタイヤは左右が別々に回れるもん。差動装置ってのが入ってるんだもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 340.66,
      "end_sec": 345.66
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "normal",
      "text": "それの方が便利そうなのだ。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 345.81,
      "end_sec": 347.73
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "shirake",
      "text": "便利だもん。でもハンドルが要るもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 347.88,
      "end_sec": 350.98
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "shock",
      "text": "あっ、電車にはハンドルが無いのだ！",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 351.13,
      "end_sec": 353.66
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "yubisashi",
      "text": "そう。運転士が触ってるのは、速度を上げる操作と止める操作だけだもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 353.81,
      "end_sec": 358.61
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "gurugru",
      "text": "曲がる操作を誰もしてないのに曲がってたのだ……。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 358.76,
      "end_sec": 362.24
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "nagomi",
      "text": "レールと車輪の形だけで成立してるんだもん。150年以上そうやってきたもん。",
      "news_index": 3,
      "start_sec": 362.39,
      "end_sec": 367.65
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "kamera",
      "text": "今日は完全に負けを認めるのだ。ツバが曲げてると思ってたのだ。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 367.8,
      "end_sec": 371.94
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "amaama",
      "text": "やっと認めたもん。今日もあんこもんの勝ちだもん。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 372.09,
      "end_sec": 375.06
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "zunda",
      "tone": "niyari",
      "text": "でも、運動会のトラックの例えはボクが出したのだ。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 375.21,
      "end_sec": 379.21
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "ankomon",
      "tone": "tsuntsun",
      "text": "……それは、聞かなかったことにするもん。",
      "news_index": 0,
      "start_sec": 379.36,
      "end_sec": 381.63
    },
    {
      "index": 9999,
      "type": "outro",
      "text": "🎵 ジングル + またね！",
      "start_sec": 382.33,
      "end_sec": 390.03
    }
  ],
